- In this lab also we know the admin panel is at "/admin" but we can't perform the required operation of deleting "Carlos"
- Because we don't have access, but in the question it is given, user with "roleid" 2 will have access to admin panel

- Now start your Burp Suite and login with the default creds.
- This time we will send a "Change Email" request.
- Now send this request from "Request Tab" to "repeater tab" (right click on request and click on "Send to repeater").
- There will be JSON format request at the botton of it.
- In it add "roleid":2 and then send it.
- In the Response tab you will see that the "roleid" is being updated for the default user.
- And the admin panel is now accessable.
- Go to admin Panel, delete the user and your lab is completed.

